# basePath DesignPMOS
// PMOS

::Intro
@trigger    OnDesignSetupComplete
$set temp:hintGiven = 0
{@PAL} Use both doping types to make a transistor that starts blocked, and opens with the right signal.

::Hints
@trigger    OnSingleTestComplete
@when       result == "failure"
$if temp:hintGiven == 0
    {@PAL}  <color=yellow>Hint:</color> Check the Verification Table. When A is LO, let signal through to X.
    $set temp:hintGiven = 1
$elseif temp:hintGiven == 1
    {@PAL}  <color=yellow>Hint:</color> Use alternating “P-N-P” semiconductor to make a blocked gate a blocked gate, opened by LO.
    $set temp:hintGiven = 2
$elseif temp:hintGiven == 2
    {@PAL}  <color=yellow>Hint:</color> A controls the gate, and B reaches the output.
    $set temp:hintGiven = 0
$endif